_R32_00000":"Wait up!\\nWhat’s the hurry?\\r","msg_0380_R32_00001":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, right?\\nSome guy wearing glasses was looking\\ffor you.\\rSee for yourself. He’s waiting for\\nyou at the Poké Mart.","msg_0380_R32_00002":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, right?\\nSome guy wearing glasses was looking\\ffor you.\\rSee for yourself. He’s waiting for\\nyou at the Poké Mart.\\r","msg_0380_R32_00003":"Have you gone to the Pokémon Gym?\\rYou can test your Pokémon and\\nyourself there.\\rIt’s a rite of passage for all Trainers!","msg_0380_R32_00004":"Have you gone to the Pokémon Gym?\\rYou can test your Pokémon and\\nyourself there.\\rIt’s a rite of passage for all Trainers!\\r","msg_0380_R32_00005":"You have some good Pokémon there.\\rIt must be from the training you gave\\nthem around Violet City.\\rThe training at the Gym must have\\nbeen especially helpful.\\rAs a souvenir of Violet City, take this.\\rIt increases the power of\\nGrass-type moves.\\r","msg_0380_R32_00006":"","msg_0380_R32_00007":"Your experiences in Violet City\\nshould be useful for your journey.","msg_0380_R32_00008":"Hey, your Bag is chock-full.","msg_0380_R32_00009":"Hey, your Bag is chock-full.\\r","msg_0380_R32_00010":"WROOOOAR!\\rPEOPLE RUN WHEN I ROAR!\\nBUT YOU CAME LOOKING!\\rTHAT PLEASES ME!\\nNOW TAKE THIS!\\r","msg_0380_R32_00011":"","msg_0380_R32_00012":"WROOOAR!\\nIT’S ROAR!\\rEVEN POKéMON RUN\\nFROM A GOOD ROAR!","msg_0380_R32_00013":"WROOOAR! YOUR BAG IS FULL!","msg_0380_R32_00014":"How would you like to have this\\ntasty, nutritious SlowpokeTail?\\rFor you right now, just $1,000,000!\\nYou’ll want this! {YESNO 0}","msg_0380_R32_00015":"Tch! I thought kids these days\\nwere loaded...","msg_0380_R32_00016":"You don’t want it?\\nThen scram. Shoo!","msg_0380_R32_00017":"Rt. 32\\nSouth to Azalea Town","msg_0380_R32_00018":"Ruins of Alph\\nEast Entrance","msg_0380_R32_00019":"Union Cave ahead"},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_R32_004 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_R32_